{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《商業內幕》報道，AI公司Hugging Face周四宣佈推出新AI模型Carbon-X，有望幫助科學家更輕鬆地研究DNA並開發新的基因療法。Hugging Face稱，Carbon-X是一個擁有140億參數、用於DNA理解和生成的開放模型。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583528.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.833457+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:34:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"fa3c154d6479711d9691c9e6c19017b12cf863613df9295f7a60dd8da7c5938c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}